<title>HONG KONG: Int'l BK of Asia sets HK$75 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Int'l BK of Asia sets HK$75 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Bank of Asia's HK$75 million floating rate certificate of deposit has been privately placed, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the one-year facility was priced at par to float at 30 basis points over the Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Fees were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Jardine Fleming is the sole arranger.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
